{"audit_run_id":"audit:f3512a0d66884540b6f2401c47779983","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":90,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"Occupational health monitoring of hospital cleaning staff on general wards, comparing two"},{"end_column":73,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"disinfectant application methods used at the same product concentration."},{"end_column":101,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"**One row is one cleaning worker**, measured once at the end of a single monitored shift by the same"},{"end_column":95,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"occupational hygiene team. There are 58 rows plus a header row: 29 workers in each application"},{"end_column":77,"end_line":8,"start_column":1,"start_line":8,"text":"method group. Every worker has a value in every column; there are no blanks."},{"end_column":40,"end_line":12,"start_column":1,"start_line":12,"text":"| Column | Type | Units | Description |"},{"end_column":26,"end_line":13,"start_column":1,"start_line":13,"text":"| --- | --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":112,"end_line":14,"start_column":1,"start_line":14,"text":"| `worker_id` | text | none | Anonymous identifier for the worker, `W001` through `W058`. Unique in the file. |"},{"end_column":164,"end_line":15,"start_column":1,"start_line":15,"text":"| `application_method` | text | none | Application method the worker used during the monitored shift. Exactly two values: `trigger_spray` and `pre_soaked_wipes`. |"},{"end_column":145,"end_line":16,"start_column":1,"start_line":16,"text":"| `fev1_l` | number | litres (L) | Declared outcome 1. Forced expiratory volume in one second, measured by spirometry at the end of the shift. |"},{"end_column":129,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"| `feno_ppb` | number | parts per billion (ppb) | Declared outcome 2. Fractional exhaled nitric oxide at the end of the shift. |"},{"end_column":149,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"| `airway_symptom_score` | integer | none (0-20 scale) | Declared outcome 3. Airway symptom questionnaire score, where higher means more symptoms. |"},{"end_column":177,"end_line":19,"start_column":1,"start_line":19,"text":"| `peak_tvoc_mg_m3` | number | milligrams per cubic metre (mg/m3) | Declared outcome 4. Peak airborne total volatile organic compounds measured on the worker during cleaning. |"},{"end_column":151,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"| `eye_skin_irritation_score` | integer | none (0-10 scale) | Declared outcome 5. Eye and skin irritation score, where higher means more irritation. |"},{"end_column":101,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"The five outcome columns appear in the order the five outcomes were declared in the monitoring plan."},{"end_column":46,"end_line":26,"start_column":1,"start_line":26,"text":"- `fev1_l`: 2.41 to 4.10, two decimal places."},{"end_column":46,"end_line":27,"start_column":1,"start_line":27,"text":"- `feno_ppb`: 7.4 to 43.8, one decimal place."},{"end_column":50,"end_line":28,"start_column":1,"start_line":28,"text":"- `airway_symptom_score`: 0 to 12, whole numbers."},{"end_column":55,"end_line":29,"start_column":1,"start_line":29,"text":"- `peak_tvoc_mg_m3`: 0.33 to 3.39, two decimal places."},{"end_column":54,"end_line":30,"start_column":1,"start_line":30,"text":"- `eye_skin_irritation_score`: 0 to 6, whole numbers."},{"end_column":103,"end_line":34,"start_column":1,"start_line":34,"text":"`data.csv` is a fixed authored file. Values were written once to be realistic for this setting and are"},{"end_column":34,"end_line":35,"start_column":1,"start_line":35,"text":"not regenerated at analysis time."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:a4e2ecdbe94009574e2e","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:c3f650bd119b0ec6c934a91f3de6229286a92686da1f525ebf49977a4ddd4da0","end_line":35,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-35","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:f3512a0d66884540b6f2401c47779983","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":94,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"This study compares the two groups recorded in the `application_method` column of `data.csv`."},{"end_column":142,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"The pre-declared outcome family, in this fixed order, is: fev1_l, feno_ppb, airway_symptom_score, peak_tvoc_mg_m3, eye_skin_irritation_score."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Each outcome is compared between the two groups. The named outcomes form one outcome"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"family; per-outcome comparisons over this family require complete-family control of the"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"family-wise error from multiple comparisons."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:00d30f88aefb4afcf01a","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:015660325d8af924888e8a8eee14b6120f5028506b7c3cea76cba5ae53973dd5","end_line":7,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-7","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
